        [435161] = "Buy Palehide Mushan Beast from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Shrine of Two Moons (26.0, 49.0) for 2,200 Bronze.\n\nMists of Pandaria Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nPandaria Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [437162] = "Original Plunderstorm acquisition: play the Plunderstorm event from the character-selection screen, collect Plunder through matches and its daily quest, then buy Polly Roger for 5,000 Plunder in the Plunderstore.\n\nThe first event also awarded it at Renown 39 with Keg Leg's Crew.\n\nThis recorded event has ended. The item is an event reward, with no ordinary world drop or permanent gold vendor; another opportunity depends on its inclusion in a returning Plunderstorm event.\n\nRequires Renown 39 with Keg Leg's Crew.",
        [439138] = "Earn Awakening the Dragonflight Raids: Account-wide progress Complete all three Awakened raids on Normal difficulty or higher in Dragonflight Season 4. - Awakened Storms - Awakened Flames - Awakened Shadows\n\nThe Dragonflight Season 4 Awakened raid mount reward ended with The War Within launch.",
        [440444] = "Earn Back from the Beyond: 100 Points Account-wide progress Leave the Shadowlands better than they were when you entered by completing the following achievements. - Castle Nathria - Dead Men Tell Some Tales - From A to Zereth - Myths of the Shadowlands Dungeons - Re-Re-Re-Renowned - Sanctum of Domination - Sepulcher of the First Ones - Tower Ranger - Chains of Domination - Fake It 'Til You Make It - Many, Many Things - On the Offensive - Sanctum Superior - Secrets of the First Ones - Shadowlands Dilettante - Walking in Maw-mphis",
        [441324] = "Buy Remembered Golden Gryphon from Remembrancer Amuul in Dalaran Underbelly (33.3, 84.6) for 20,000 Residual Memories.\n\nThe Radiant Echoes pre-expansion event has ended; this mount has no current vendor source.",
        [441325] = "Buy Remembered Wind Rider from Remembrancer Amuul in Dalaran Underbelly (33.3, 84.6) for 20,000 Residual Memories.\n\nThe Radiant Echoes pre-expansion event has ended; this mount has no current vendor source.",
        [441794] = "Buy Amber Pterrordax from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Shrine of Two Moons (26.0, 49.0) for 4,400 Bronze.\n\nMists of Pandaria Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nPandaria Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [442358] = "Defeat High Speaker Eirich in The Stonevault on Mythic difficulty for a chance at the Malfunctioning Mechsuit. Use that item to begin the associated repair quest, take it to the repair contact in the Ringing Deeps, and complete the component errands through A Mech in Need. Finishing the repair chain awards the Stonevault Mechsuit. The source notes track the first unfinished quest once you have obtained the starter.",
        [446017] = "Earn Time Trial: Account-wide progress Reach level 20 with a Timerunner. - Reach Level 20 with a Timerunner Mount: August Phoenix\n\nMists of Pandaria Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nPandaria Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [446022] = "Earn Vale of Eternal Blossoms: Account-wide progress Complete two of the following achievements with a Timerunner. - Looking For Group: Vale of Eternal Blossoms - The August Celestials - Golden Lotus - Elusive Foes: Vale of Eternal Blossoms Mount: Astral Emperor's Serpent\n\nMists of Pandaria Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nPandaria Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [446052] = "Complete Ship It! from Brann Bronzebeard in Dornogal (47.4, 44.4) to receive Delver's Dirigible.\n\nObjectives: - Speak with Brann Bronzebeard",
        [447057] = "Buy Smoldering Cinderbee from Auditor Balwurz in Dornogal (39.1, 24.0) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 23 with Council of Dornogal.",
        [447151] = "Buy Soaring Meaderbee from Cendvin in Isle of Dorn (74.4, 45.2) for 900 Sizzling Cinderpollen.",
        [447160] = "Earn Ruffious's Bid: 25 Points Account-wide progress Complete the World PvP achievements listed below. - Unbound Battle - Tour of Duty: Isle of Dorn - Tour of Duty: Hallowfall - A Champion's Tour: Dragon Isles - Tour of Duty: The Ringing Deeps - Tour of Duty: Azj-Kahet",
        [447176] = "Buy Cyan Glowmite from Waxmonger Squick in The Ringing Deeps (43.1, 32.9) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 23 with Assembly of the Deeps.",
        [447185] = "Buy Aquamarine Swarmite from Lady Vinazian in Azj-Kahet (55.3, 41.2) for 3,940 Kej.\n\nRequires Renown 23 with Severed Threads.",
        [447189] = "Defeat Nesting Swarmite in Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar (40.3, 79.4) and loot Nesting Swarmite. This is a chance drop.\n\nHas a chance to spawn from piles of Trash in either vision.",
        [447190] = "Earn Glory of the Nerub-ar Raider: 25 Points Account-wide progress Complete the Nerub-ar Palace raid achievements listed below. - Slimy Yet Satisfying - Sik Parry Bro - Would You Still /love Me if I Was a Worm... - Love is in the Lair - You Can't See Me - Cowabunga - Kill Streak - Missed 'Em by That Much",
        [447195] = "Earn Khaz Algar Glyph Hunter: 20 Points Account-wide progress Complete the following Glyph Hunter achievements in Khaz Algar: - Isle of Dorn - Hallowfall - The Ringing Deeps - Azj-Kahet",
        [447213] = "Kill creatures on the Isle of Dorn until you collect 10 Crackling Shards. The shards bind to your Warband, so you can consolidate drops from your characters. Combine all ten into a Storm Vessel, fly to Alunira above Dhar Oztan (23.1, 58.5), and use your vessel to remove her Protective Stormshroud. Defeat her and loot the mount. Use your own vessel: merely tagging another player's summoned fight does not guarantee the mount. Alunira is an enemy whose shield consumes the vessel, not a merchant selling the mount.",
        [447405] = "Buy Vicious Skyflayer from Deathguard Netharian in Orgrimmar (41.8, 73.0) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [447957] = "Buy Ferocious Jawcrawler from Lady Vinazian in Azj-Kahet (55.3, 41.2) for 2,815 Kej.\n\nRequires Renown 22 with Severed Threads.",
        [448186] = "Buy a completed Crowd Pummeler 2-30 on the Auction House, or build it with Khaz Algar Engineering. To learn the schematic, use Invent and the resulting Comprehensibly Organized Ideas until this recipe is offered. Craft it using 1 Pummel Permit, 1,000 Bountiful Bolts, 200 Assorted Whirligigs, 80 Blinker Fluid, 50 Cataclysmic Converters and 20 Pummel-Proof Plating. Paxton Bombshell at Opportunity Point in the Ringing Deeps sells the special parts; the Parts specialization also allows rare components to be recovered with Pilfer Through Parts. The finished mount can be traded, so you do not need Engineering to learn a purchased copy.",
        [448188] = "Loot Awakened Cache in The Ringing Deeps (43.3, 31.9) to obtain Machine Defense Unit 1-11.",
        [448680] = "Buy Widow's Undercrawler from Bobbin in Azj-Kahet (56.4, 43.3) for 2,020 Kej.\n\nRequires Renown 8 with The Weaver.",
        [448685] = "Buy Heritage Undercrawler from Anub'okki in Azj-Kahet (55.9, 42.1) for 2,020 Kej.\n\nRequires Renown 8 with The General.",
        [448689] = "Buy Royal Court Undercrawler from Tulumun in Azj-Kahet (45.0, 16.7) for 2,020 Kej.\n\nRequires Renown 8 with The Vizier.",
        [448934] = "Earn You Xal Not Pass: 40 Points Account-wide progress End Xal'atath's schemes (for now) by completing the achievements below. - Slate of the Union - Crystal Chronicled - Isle Remember You - Rage Aside the Machine - Azj the World Turns",
        [448939] = "Buy Shackled Shadow from Auralia Steelstrike in Hallowfall (41.3, 53.1) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 23 with Hallowfall Arathi.",
        [448941] = "Defeat Beledar's Spawn in Hallowfall (48.9, 32.0) and loot Beledar's Spawn. This is a chance drop.\n\nSpawns immediately somewhere in the zone the moment Beledar shifts into its Void state.",
        [448978] = "Buy Vermillion Imperial Lynx from Auralia Steelstrike in Hallowfall (41.3, 53.1) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 21 with Hallowfall Arathi.",
        [448979] = "Reach Renown 3 with the Hallowfall Arathi and go to the spreading-the-light area around Light's Blooming (65.4, 32.2). Farm Radiant Remnants from nearby enemies and use them to light Lesser and Major Keyflames. Complete the weekly quests and bonus objectives those flames unlock, then open their Lamplighter Supply Satchels for a chance at the Dauntless Imperial Lynx. Each flame's reward is limited by its weekly activity; a satchel is not a guaranteed mount.",
        [449258] = "Defeat Lurker of the Deeps in The Ringing Deeps (45.3, 8.8) and loot Ol' Mole Rufus. This is a chance drop.\n\nInteract with 5 levers located across the zone within 10 seconds to summon this rare.",
        [449264] = "Defeat The Darkness on Mythic difficulty in The Ringing Deeps (55.4, 21.6) and loot Wick. This is a chance drop.",
        [449269] = "Buy Crimson Mudnose from Waxmonger Squick in The Ringing Deeps (43.1, 32.9) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 19 with Assembly of the Deeps.",
        [449325] = "Buy Vicious Skyflayer from Necrolord Sipe in Stormwind City (76.8, 65.6) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [449415] = "Earn Allied Races: Earthen: 10 Points Account-wide progress Complete the War Within storylines listed below. - The War Within campaign - Broken Tools - Mourning Rise - Merrix and Steelvein",
        [449418] = "Buy Shale Ramolith from Auditor Balwurz in Dornogal (39.1, 24.0) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 18 with Council of Dornogal.",
        [449466] = "Earn Gladiator: The War Within Season 1: Win 50 3v3 games while at Elite rank during The War Within Season 1. - Win 50 Games as a Gladiator in The War Within Season 1 in 3v3\n\nThe original rated Arena season has ended. Its Gladiator mount cannot be earned in a later season.",
        [451486] = "Defeat Queen Ansurek in Azj-Kahet (35.6, 71.6) and loot Sureki Skyrazor. This is a chance drop.",
        [451489] = "Defeat Tka'ktath near the City of Threads in Azj-Kahet (62.8, 66.6) and loot a Vial of Tka'ktath's Blood. Use it to start The Beginning of Something Beautiful, then take it to Shalba in the City of Threads (45.4, 13.5). Complete her gathering quests in order: 1,500 Nerubian Chitin, then 1,000 Nerubian Venom, then 500 Nerubian Blood. Kill nerubians for chitin and venom; ascended nerubians and skyrazors supply blood. Follower Ara-Kara runs are one farming option. Return each batch before gathering the next quest's items, watch Witnessing Brilliance, and finish Consolation Flies for Siesbarg.",
        [451491] = "Defeat Queen Ansurek on Mythic difficulty in Azj-Kahet (35.6, 71.6) and loot Ascendant Skyrazor. This is a chance drop.",
        [452779] = "Earn Glory of the War Within Delver: 25 Points Account-wide progress Complete the War Within delve achievements listed below. - Delve Loremaster: War Within - Sporesweeper - Daystormer - Brann Development or Branntastic - The War Within: Leave No Treasure Unfound - Spider Senses - Defeat the current Seasonal Nemesis or any The War Within Nemesis once Midnight has launched",
        [453785] = "Unlock the Earthen allied race, create an Earthen Paladin, and reach level 10 on that character. The Earthen Ordinant's Ramolith is the Earthen paladin class mount and is learned through that character unlock; another race or class cannot buy it from a mount vendor.",
        [457656] = "Original Plunderstorm acquisition: play the Plunderstorm event from the character-selection screen, collect Plunder through matches and its daily quest, then buy Plunderlord's Midnight Crocolisk for 5,000 Plunder in the Plunderstore.\n\nThis recorded event has ended. The item is an event reward, with no ordinary world drop or permanent gold vendor; another opportunity depends on its inclusion in a returning Plunderstorm event.",
        [458335] = "Buy Diamond Mechsuit from Lindormi in Silvermoon City (42.1, 58.8) for 1 Timelost Saddle.",
        [465999] = "Buy Crimson Armored Growler from Rocco Razzboom in Undermine (39.2, 22.2) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Exalted with Bilgewater Cartel.",
        [466000] = "Buy Darkfuse Chompactor from Ando the Gat in Undermine (42.0, 50.2).\n\nRequires Renown 17 with Gallagio Loyalty Rewards Club.",
        [466001] = "Open Blackwater Trove in Undermine (63.2, 17.2) for a chance at Blackwater Bonecrusher.\n\nRequires Exalted with Blackwater Cartel.",
        [466002] = "Buy Violet Armored Growler from Smaks Topskimmer in Undermine (43.6, 50.8) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 15 with The Cartels of Undermine.",
        [466011] = "Buy Flarendo the Furious from Ando the Gat in Undermine (42.0, 50.2).\n\nRequires Renown 20 with Gallagio Loyalty Rewards Club.",
        [466012] = "Buy Thunderdrum Misfire from Ando the Gat in Undermine (42.0, 50.2).\n\nRequires Renown 8 with Gallagio Loyalty Rewards Club.",
        [466013] = "Buy Ochre Delivery Rocket from Shredz the Scrapper in Undermine (53.3, 72.7) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Exalted with Venture Company.",
        [466014] = "Open Steamwheedle Trove in Undermine (27.6, 72.8) for a chance at Steamwheedle Supplier.\n\nRequires Exalted with Steamwheedle Cartel.",
        [466016] = "Buy The Topskimmer Special from Smaks Topskimmer in Undermine (43.6, 50.8) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 19 with The Cartels of Undermine.",
        [466017] = "Buy Innovation Investigator from Skedgit Cinderbangs in Undermine (43.0, 82.8) for 25 Miscellaneous Mechanica.",
        [466018] = "Buy Darkfuse Demolisher from Sitch Lowdown in Undermine (30.8, 38.2) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Revered with Darkfuse Solutions.",
        [466019] = "Buy Blackwater Shredder Deluxe Mk 2 from Boatswain Hardee in Undermine (63.4, 16.7) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Exalted with Blackwater Cartel.",
        [466020] = "Open Sifted Pile of Scrap in Undermine (25.8, 38.1) for a chance at Personalized Goblin S.C.R.A.P.per. Obtain the container with 333 Empty Kaja'Cola Can.\n\nFrequently around the zone a pile of scrap will be marked on the map, ready for excavation. Once started, there is a two minute timer to dig up as much as possible, clearing obstacles and dodging projectiles. Renown unlocks new drops and efficiency upgrades, and a rare mob can sometimes spawn at max excavation progress.",
        [466021] = "Unlock the D.R.I.V.E. G-99 Breakneck through the Undermine introduction, then take Shipping and Handling jobs in Undermine. Finish ten jobs in succession without cancelling your streak and open the resulting reward for a chance at the Violet Goblin Shredder. Surge Pricing starts at the half-hour mark and improves job rewards during its ten-minute window. Keep completing streaks; this mount is a random reward.",
        [466022] = "Open Venture Co. Trove in Undermine (53.2, 72.6) for a chance at Venture Co-ordinator.\n\nRequires Exalted with Venture Company.",
        [466023] = "Buy Asset Advocator from Skedgit Cinderbangs in Undermine (43.0, 82.8) for 25 Miscellaneous Mechanica.",
        [466024] = "Open Bilgewater Trove in Undermine (39.1, 22.2) for a chance at Bilgewater Bombardier.\n\nRequires Exalted with Bilgewater Cartel.",
        [466025] = "Buy Margin Manipulator from Skedgit Cinderbangs in Undermine (43.0, 82.8) for 25 Miscellaneous Mechanica.",
        [466026] = "Defeat Gallagio Garbage in Undermine and loot Salvaged Goblin Gazillionaire's Flying Machine. This is a chance drop.\n\nFrequently around the zone a pile of scrap will be marked on the map, ready for excavation. Once started, there is a two minute timer to dig up as much as possible, clearing obstacles and dodging projectiles. Renown unlocks new drops and efficiency upgrades, and a rare mob can sometimes spawn at max excavation progress.\n\nCan spawn when players fill the 'Trash Shoveled' progress bar to 500 during a S.C.R.A.P. Job event in Undermine. Note: All loot can drop even when the daily flag is saved.",
        [466027] = "Defeat Darkfuse Precipitant in Undermine (41.2, 91.4) and loot Darkfuse Spy-Eye. This is a chance drop.\n\nRequires someone with Renown 6 with the Cartels of Undermine and in possession of a 'Canister of Darkfuse Solution' to interact with the De-Pollution Station X1119 to start an event to spawn it.",
        [466028] = "Buy Mean Green Flying Machine from Lab Assistant Laszly in Undermine (27.5, 72.8) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Exalted with Steamwheedle Cartel.",
        [466133] = "Buy Delver's Gob-Trotter from Reno Jackson in Dornogal (47.6, 45.0) for 10,000 Resonance Crystals.",
        [466144] = "Earn Gladiator: The War Within Season 2: Win 50 3v3 games while at Elite rank during The War Within Season 2. - Win 50 Games as a Gladiator in The War Within Season 2 in 3v3\n\nThe original rated Arena season has ended. Its Gladiator mount cannot be earned in a later season.",
        [466145] = "Buy Vicious Electro Eel from Deathguard Netharian in Orgrimmar (41.8, 73.0) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [466146] = "Buy Vicious Electro Eel from Necrolord Sipe in Stormwind City (76.8, 65.6) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [468068] = "Earn Glory of the Liberation of Undermine Raider: 10 Points Account-wide progress Complete the Liberation of Undermine raid achievements listed below. - Hold My Gear! - The Splash Zone - Conveyor Slayer - Sleep with the Fishes - One Rank Higher - Just /Dance - Garbage In, Garbage Out - Scheming on a Thing",
        [471538] = "Buy Timely Buzzbee from Cupri in Shattrath City - 54.4, 38.8 for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [471562] = "Finish Siren Isle's story, then enter Seafury Tempest through Suzie Boltwrench (69.0, 49.2). Collect five runekeys during the storm. Cyclonic drops from Zek'ul at (33.0, 73.6), or fishing nearby. Whirling drops from Ksvir in the Forgotten Vault. Make Turbulent from three fragments at (38.2, 51.9), (67.2, 78.8) and inside the cave starting at (50.2, 42.4). Make Torrential from seven fragments dropped by storm enemies, and Thunderous from five fragments in Rune Storm Caches revealed with Runecaster's Eye. Enter the vault via the cave at (44.8, 22.4) and Singing Tablet at (50.2, 15.5). Use the keys on the stones surrounding Thrayir in the vault (72.7, 61.4), then accept his quest to learn the mount.",
        [471696] = "Original Plunderstorm acquisition: play the Plunderstorm event from the character-selection screen, collect Plunder through matches and its daily quest, then buy Hooktalon for 5,000 Plunder in the Plunderstore.\n\nThis recorded event has ended. The item is an event reward, with no ordinary world drop or permanent gold vendor; another opportunity depends on its inclusion in a returning Plunderstorm event.",
        [472157] = "Earn Gladiator: The War Within Season 3: Win 50 3v3 games while at Elite rank during The War Within Season 3. - Win 50 Games as a Gladiator in The War Within Season 3 in 3v3\n\nThe original rated Arena season has ended. Its Gladiator mount cannot be earned in a later season.",
        [472752] = "Earn Isle Remember You: 15 Points Account-wide progress Complete all the Siren Isle achievements listed below. - A Song of Secrets - Excavation Projects - Treasures of the Storm - Siren-ity Now! - Clean Up on Isle Siren - A Choir of Citrine",
        [473137] = "Buy Soweezi's Vintage Waveshredder from Soweezi in Siren Isle (70.0, 48.4) for 10,000 Flame-Blessed Iron.",
        [473188] = "Open Darkfuse Trove in Undermine (30.8, 38.2) for a chance at Bronze Goblin Waveshredder.\n\nRequires Exalted with Darkfuse Solutions.",
        [473472] = "Earn A Farewell to Arms: 100 Points Account-wide progress Put an end to the Battle for Azeroth by completing the following achievements. - Uldir - Crucible of Storms - Ny'alotha, the Waking City - I'm On Island Time - Azerothian Diplomat - Maximum Effort - Mecha-Done - Through the Depths of Visions - Dressed to Kill: Battle for Azeroth - Battle of Dazar'alor - The Eternal Palace - Battle for Azeroth Dungeon Hero - War Stories - Expedition Leader - Undersea Usurper - Black Empire State of Mind - Full Heart, Can't Lose - To All the Squirrels I Set Sail to See",
        [474086] = "Complete A Loyal Friend from Mature Prismatic Snapdragon in Siren Isle (70.9, 48.6) to receive Prismatic Snapdragon.\n\nObjectives: - Speak To The Snapdragon",
        [1214920] = "Buy Nightfall Skyreaver from Kronnus in Warspear (42.8, 54.5) for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1214940] = "Buy Ur'zul Fleshripper from Aridormi in Dalaran (Broken Isles) (68.6, 49.2) for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1214946] = "Buy Broodling of Sinestra from Kiatke for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1214974] = "Buy Copper-Maned Quilen from Mistweaver Xia in Timeless Isle (43.0, 55.4) for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1217235] = "Buy Crimson Shreddertank from Lindormi in Silvermoon City (42.1, 58.8) for 1 Timelost Saddle.",
        [1217760] = "Enter Liberation of Undermine through the Incontinental Hotel in Undermine (42.0, 50.2) on Mythic difficulty. Defeat the final boss, Chrome King Gallywix, and loot The Big G. Normal, Heroic and Raid Finder do not award this mount. You have one eligible Mythic boss loot opportunity per character each weekly reset, and the mount is shared raid loot rather than a personal reward for every participant.",
        [1218229] = "Enter the revisited Horrific Vision of Stormwind with at least two Faceless Masks active and clear the Trade District. Read the two ripped notes near (68.6, 73.3) and (65.7, 71.6). Match the requested ingredient and preparation: raw fish = Fresh Fillet; cooked fish = Skewered Fillet; raw fungus = Chopped Mycobloom; cooked fungus = Roasted Mycobloom; raw spiced meat = Spiced Meat Stock; cooked spiced meat = Simple Stew; raw steak = Portioned Steak; cooked steak = Unseasoned Field Steak. Place the matching food in the Claw Marked Bowl (68.1, 73.4), rattle it, then defeat the arriving Void-Scarred Gryphon and loot its reins.",
        [1218305] = "Defeat Void-Forged Stallion in Horrific Vision of Stormwind (50.9, 84.0) and loot Void-Forged Stallion. This is a chance drop.\n\nInteract with Cursed Horseshoes around Stormwind's districts to gain a stacking buff, visit the blacksmithing area in the Dwarven District to summon the rare when you have 4 stacks. Requires an active Mask",
        [1218306] = "Defeat Void-Scarred Wolf in Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar (39.2, 49.5) and loot Void-Scarred Pack Mother. This is a chance drop.\n\nInteract with Wolf Rider gear in the Valleys of Honor and Wisdom to gain a stacking buff, then interact with a wolf rug at the Drag's leatherworking shop to spawn the rare. Wolf rider packs are only visible with an active Mask.",
        [1218307] = "Defeat Void-Scarred Wyvern Matriarch in Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar (48.9, 51.6) and loot Void-Scarred Windrider. This is a chance drop.\n\nClear the Valley of Wisdom to access the elevator up to the Skyway. Defeat waves of Void-Scarred Wyverns until the matriarch spawns. The path up to the Skyway will remain blocked without at least 3 masks active.",
        [1218314] = "Earn Mastering the Visions: 20 Points Account-wide progress Complete the Revisited Horrific Vision achievements listed below. - Beyond the Most Horrific Vision of Stormwind - Beyond the Most Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar",
        [1218316] = "Buy Corruption of the Aspects from Torie in Dornogal (34.4, 68.4) for 40,000 Displaced Corrupted Mementos.",
        [1218317] = "Use a character with Khaz Algar Jewelcrafting 30. Enter the revisited Horrific Vision of Orgrimmar with at least one Faceless Mask and defeat Big Keech in the Valley of Honor (72.4, 34.9) for the design and Void-Bound Orb of Mystery. With the orb acquired and a mask active, collect 20 Shadow Infused Onyx from corrupted-area chests, Unusual Gems from Valeera's chest after clearing Old Town in Stormwind, and 4 Black Blood Infused Bars from the vision blacksmithing areas. Learn the design and craft the panther at a jeweler's bench. The finished mount binds to your Warband; it is not an ordinary Auction House panther.",
        [1221132] = "Complete The Hope of K'aresh from Ve'nari in K'aresh (75.9, 34.2) to receive Resplendent K'arroc.\n\nObjectives: - Speak with Hemet Nesingwary - Speak with Botanist Alaenra - Speak with Rhubarn - Speak with Om'talad - Speak with Ve'nari",
        [1221155] = "Defeat Chrome King Gallywix, the final boss of Liberation of Undermine, and check the boss loot for Prototype A.S.M.R. It can drop on Raid Finder, Normal, Heroic or Mythic difficulty. The raid entrance is in the Incontinental Hotel in Undermine (42.0, 50.2). This is a rare drop with an eligible loot opportunity per difficulty each weekly reset; the different mount, The Big G, is Mythic only.",
        [1221694] = "Buy Enterprising Shreddertank from Lindormi in Silvermoon City (42.1, 58.8) for 1 Timelost Saddle.",
        [1223187] = "Buy Terror of the Wastes from Om'sirik in Tazavesh, the Veiled Market (40.6, 29.2) for 11,375 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 19 with The K'aresh Trust.",
        [1223191] = "Earn Vigilante: 10 Points Complete all Warrants in K'aresh. - Arcana-Monger So'zer - Purple Peat - Hollowbane - Grubber - Shatterpulse - Xy'vox the Twisted",
        [1224048] = "The former Season 3 reward quest has retired. Buy the base Mana-Skimmer from Reno Jackson at Delver's Headquarters; its schematics are separate purchases.",
        [1226144] = "Buy Chrono Corsair from Cupri in Shattrath City - 54.4, 38.8 for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1226421] = "Buy Radiant Imperial Lynx from Lars Bronsmaelt in Hallowfall (28.3, 56.2) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 9 with Flame's Radiance.",
        [1227076] = "Buy Tyrannotort from Wodin the Troll-Servant in Stormwind City (67.2, 81.0) for 100 Resonance Crystals.\n\nDastardly Duos has ended. Only characters with the original Week 4 quest unlock can buy this mount from Wodin.",
        [1228865] = "Go to the Nightfall camp at Flame's Radiance in Hallowfall and complete the daily Radiant Incursion or Sureki Incursion assignments. Open the Arathi Soldier's Coffer awarded by those dailies for a chance at the Void-Scarred Lynx. Repeat on later days if it does not drop; this mount is a coffer reward rather than the Nightfall reputation vendor mount.",
        [1229276] = "Buy Bloodhunter Fel Bat from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1229283] = "Buy Ashplague Fel Bat from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1229288] = "Buy Wretched Fel Bat from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1233511] = "Earn Glory of the Omega Raider: 25 Points Account-wide progress Complete the Manaforge Omega raid achievements listed below. - Of Mice and Manaforges - Mother of All Tantrums - I See... Absolutely Nothing - King's Ransom - Time to Vote! Cute or Scary? - Cheat Meal - Breaking the Fourth Wall - Defying Gravity",
        [1233516] = "Complete Off to Tazavesh, Again from Arator in K'aresh (60.8, 28.1) to receive K'arroc Swiftwing.\n\nObjectives: - Ask Ve'nari about getting to the Maw - Speak with Alleria - Regroup with Arator & Ve'nari at Tazavesh",
        [1233518] = "Buy Lavender K'arroc from Shad'anis in K'aresh (50.4, 36.3) for 10 Untethered Coin.",
        [1233542] = "Complete Freezing Over from Zo'turu in K'aresh (42.0, 22.1) to receive The Bone Freezer.\n\nRequires Renown 14 with Manaforge Vandals.",
        [1233546] = "Buy Ruby Void Creeper from Om'sirik in Tazavesh, the Veiled Market (40.6, 29.2) for 8,125 Resonance Crystals.\n\nRequires Renown 15 with The K'aresh Trust.",
        [1233547] = "Buy Acidic Void Creeper from Shad'anis in K'aresh (50.4, 36.3) for 7 Untethered Coin.",
        [1233559] = "Complete A Blue for You from Griftah in Tazavesh, the Veiled Market (48.7, 41.5) to receive Blue Barry.\n\nReceive your reward.\n\nRequires Renown 9 with The K'aresh Trust.",
        [1233561] = "Open Wriggling Pinnacle Cache in K'aresh (74.1, 32.6) for a chance at Curious Slateback.\n\nOnly the first Bag of the Week on your entire B.Net Account can contain a Pet or a Mount!",
        [1234573] = "Enter Manaforge Omega in K'aresh (41.9, 21.5) on Mythic difficulty, defeat the final boss Dimensius, the All-Devouring, and loot the Unbound Star-Eater. Lower difficulties do not drop this mount. The boss has a weekly Mythic loot lockout per character, and the raid must distribute any mount that drops.",
        [1234820] = "Buy Vicious Void Creeper from Necrolord Sipe in Stormwind City (76.8, 65.6) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [1234821] = "Buy Vicious Void Creeper from Deathguard Netharian in Orgrimmar (41.8, 73.0) for 1 Vicious Saddle.",
        [1235513] = "Buy Snowy Highmountain Eagle from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1237631] = "Buy Moonlit Nightsaber from Churbro in Zuldazar (46.1, 94.9) for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1237703] = "Buy Ivory Savagemane from Churbro in Zuldazar (46.1, 94.9) for 5,000 Timewarped Badge.",
        [1238729] = "Buy Slag Basilisk from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1240632] = "Defeat Urmag in K'aresh (70.2, 49.7) and loot Pearlescent Krolusk. This is a chance drop.",
        [1241070] = "Join Devourer attacks in K'aresh and defeat their rare elite bosses for Devoured Energy-Pods. Each rare can award one pod per Warband each week. Collect 20 pods, then combine them to create the Translocated Gorger. Defeat different event rares and continue after weekly resets; repeatedly killing one rare in the same week does not supply all 20 pods.",
        [1241076] = "Defeat Sthaarbs in K'aresh (74.0, 32.4) and loot Sthaarbs's Last Lunch. This is a chance drop.",
        [1241263] = "Buy OC91 Chariot from Reno Jackson in Dornogal (47.6, 45.0) for 10,000 Resonance Crystals.",
        [1242272] = "Complete A Twilight Oath's End in K'aresh (41.9, 21.5) to receive Royal Voidwing.\n\nThe Heroic Dimensius quest mount reward ended when Midnight launched on March 2, 2026. Mythic raid drop mounts remain obtainable.",
        [1245517] = "Buy Scarlet Void Flyer from Lindormi in Silvermoon City (42.1, 58.8) for 1 Timelost Saddle.",
        [1246781] = "Buy Azure Void Flyer from Lindormi in Silvermoon City (42.1, 58.8) for 1 Timelost Saddle.",
        [1250482] = "Buy Ghastly Ur'zul from Hemet Nesingwary XVII in Broken Isles (45.8, 68.3) for 10,000 Bronze.\n\nLegion Remix reward: this acquisition required a Timerunner during the event, which has ended.\n\nLegion Remix has ended. This event-specific mount has no current acquisition source.",
        [1250578] = "Earn Phase-Lost-and-Found: 10 Points Account-wide progress Collect all of the Phase-Lost item appearances found from Phase Diving orbs. - Phase-Lost Longsword - Phase-Lost Hammer - Phase-Lost Carver - Phase-Lost Zweihander - Phase-Lost Maul - Phase-Lost Chopper - Phase-Lost Bardiche - Phase-Lost Spire - Phase-Lost Blunderbuss - Phase-Lost Baselard - Phase-Lost Katar - Phase-Lost Sigil - Phase-Lost Bulwark - Phase-Lost Rod - Phase-Lost Scimitar - Phase-Lost Cudgel - Phase-Lost Hatchet - Phase-Lost Greatsword - Phase-Lost Great Mace - Phase-Lost Battleaxe - Phase-Lost Spear - Phase-Lost Shillelagh - Phase-Lost Longbow - Phase-Lost Dirk - Phase-Lost Claw - Phase-Lost Beacon - Phase-Lost Pavise - Phase-Lost Wand\n\nRank 3 Reshii Wraps required in order to collect the Orbs. Reward is based on a % chance. Large amount of Orbs have Fixed Coordinates. Rank 4 Reshii Wraps unlock the ability for Orbs to appear after you kill an enemy. It is possible to obtain more than 1 item from the same Orb, after it respawns.",
