        [3493] = "Earn The Gift of Cheese: 5 Points Account-wide progress Share the Recipe Rat's greatest recipe with hungry rats across Azeroth. - Rats Fed\n\nRoland will also teach your alts the recipes for Deviously Deviled Eggs and Charitable Cheddar, if you learned the recipes via the original source.",
        [3511] = "Take part in Fyrakk Assaults when active in Ohn'ahran Plains or the Azure Span. Loot the assault enemies and the event reward chest for a chance at Blaise. To open a Secured Shipment, gather the assault wards and exchange three Everburning Keys at the shipment. Complete the weekly assault as well; the pet is a random event drop rather than a wild pet you can trap.",
        [3512] = "Take part in the active Fyrakk Assault in Ohn'ahran Plains or the Azure Span. Ambre can be looted from assault enemies and the Secured Shipment. Collect assault wards to obtain Everburning Keys, then use three keys to open the shipment. Repeat eligible assault activities for another chance; Ambre cannot be captured in a wild pet battle.",
