        [4533] = "Find a wild Meek Bloodlasher in The Ringing Deeps (38.0, 36.9), start a pet battle, reduce its health below 35%, and use your trap. Win the battle to keep the captured pet.",
        [4534] = "Loot Nightfarm Growthling in Hallowfall (61.4, 31.8) to obtain Nightfarm Growthling.\n\nRequires any source of light (e.g. torch, candelabra) to reveal this treasure in any area of farmland.\n\nRequires Renown 3 with Hallowfall Arathi.",
