        [4537] = "Complete War Within delves and loot the Heavy Trunks in the treasure room after the final objective. Chester is a random delve completion reward, so open each eligible chest and repeat runs if the item does not drop. Learn Chester from the reward item; a caged copy can also be traded or bought on the Auction House.",
