        [4692] = "Original Plunderstorm acquisition: play the Plunderstorm event from the character-selection screen, collect Plunder through matches and its daily quest, then buy Sparklesnap for 2,000 Plunder in the Plunderstore.\n\nThis recorded event has ended. The item is an event reward, with no ordinary world drop or permanent gold vendor; another opportunity depends on its inclusion in a returning Plunderstorm event.",
