        [4710] = "Find a wild Pillaged Parrot in Siren Isle, start a pet battle, reduce its health below 35%, and use your trap. Win the battle to keep the captured pet.\n\nEvery week a faction invades the island. The rotation is Vrykul>Naga>Pirates repeat. Zone Drops listed here are only available when the invasion is active.\n\nOnly spawns during Pirate invasion week.",
        [4711] = "Find a wild Snapdragon Pup in Siren Isle, start a pet battle, reduce its health below 35%, and use your trap. Win the battle to keep the captured pet.\n\nEvery week a faction invades the island. The rotation is Vrykul>Naga>Pirates repeat. Zone Drops listed here are only available when the invasion is active.\n\nOnly spawns during Naga invasion week.",
        [4723] = "Find a wild Cliffreach Cub in Siren Isle, start a pet battle, reduce its health below 35%, and use your trap. Win the battle to keep the captured pet.",
        [4724] = "Find a wild Battleboar Piglet in Siren Isle, start a pet battle, reduce its health below 35%, and use your trap. Win the battle to keep the captured pet.\n\nEvery week a faction invades the island. The rotation is Vrykul>Naga>Pirates repeat. Zone Drops listed here are only available when the invasion is active.\n\nOnly spawns during Vrykul invasion week.",
        [4725] = "Titan Orb was a datamined Siren Isle pet that was removed from the collectible Pet Journal before the patch launched. It has no confirmed drop, vendor, quest or capture route. This is not the obtainable Teeny Titan Orb from the Arathi Highlands, so farming that pet's source will not unlock this species.",
        [4726] = "Finish the Siren Isle introduction and its Special Assignment, then ask Suzie Boltwrench to enter the storm phase. Kill Stormtouched Pridetalons on the peaks around (51.0, 20.0) and (42.0, 60.0) for a chance at Crackleroar. Tempest Talon can also drop it. An Experimental Go-Pack helps reach the peaks. This pet drops as an item; it cannot be trapped in a wild pet battle.",
