        [4843] = "Complete the War Within's ethereal delves, including the Archival Assault in K'aresh, then loot the Heavy Trunks in the completion treasure room for a chance at Sao'rhon. It is learned from the reward item rather than captured from the opposing pet team. Repeat completion chests if it does not drop, or buy a caged copy from another player.",
