        [4846] = "Defeat Heka'tamos in K'aresh (75.2, 31.0) and loot Heka'Tarnos, Bringer of Discord. This is a chance drop.\n\nYou need to interact with Spectral Lantern, Dewminder, Earthy Succulent, and Windcatcher inside The Oasis. Their positions are marked on the minimap. Once you have obtained the buffs, you can summon Heka'tamos at the Brazier of Elemental Union near his spawn point.",
